  "project_id": 7898047,
  "title": "RTPS: Fix NULL pointer dereference in Type Lookup Service dissection",
  "description": "Addresses Fuzz job crash: fuzz-2025-07-01-11458.pcap\n\nThis fix prevents a NULL pointer dereference that occurs when processing \nType Lookup Service packets in the RTPS dissector. The code was attempting \nto access `guid->entity_id` without first verifying that `guid` is not NULL.\n\nThe fix adds a NULL check before accessing the entity_id field.\n\nCloses #20606",
